get.summary:
A label printer and how it is: make and model, state (and why it is stopped), whether
it takes PDF (or raster), offers the "labels" paper type and actual size. Only asks;
prints nothing. `?printer=` for another than the default.

roaster_kind.description:
The roaster kind it was written for (migration 051, `docs/profiles.md`): one of the
setup kinds (`fluid_bed_electric`, `drum_electric`, `drum_gas`, `logger`, `other`);
none fits any. The library lists the selected roaster's kind first.
